# GitHub's language statistics otherwise report this as a C project. The C is
# almost entirely STMicroelectronics' HAL and USB stack: 104k lines of vendored
# driver code against roughly 1.9k lines of firmware written here. Marking the
# vendored trees keeps the language bar describing the work rather than the
# vendor drop.
firmware/cheez_emg/Drivers/**       linguist-vendored
firmware/cheez_emg/Middlewares/**   linguist-vendored
firmware/cheez_emg/USB_DEVICE/**    linguist-vendored
firmware/cheez_emg/startup_stm32f103xb.s linguist-vendored

# Core/ stays counted: CubeMX generated it, but main.c carries real changes.
